    description: "Tracker ephemeral files (.agent/.cache-*.db, .agent/.sync-logs/, .ci/pytest-output.log) need root .gitignore entries to prevent accidental commits. The tracker manages .gitignore inside its own directories but doesn't touch the root one. Setup should idempotently append tracker-specific entries. Low effort. Source: independent analyst review (tracker_feedback_03172026.txt)."  # 3900
